{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-010",
    "title": "下山旧路"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_055",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "他正要离开，沈砚秋忽然叫住他：“陆沉舟不是叛徒。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "卯时，山雾尚未散尽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1354,
          "end": 1354
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临带着沈砚秋给的铜钥匙，来到外门档房。档房在演武坪后方，门窗都用厚木封了半边，只留一道窄缝透气。门上没有匾额，只有一枚褪色的朱印，印文被磨去一角。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1356,
          "end": 1356
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他敲了三下门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1358,
          "end": 1358
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "里面传来拖椅子的声音。一个头发花白的老者探出脸来，先看钥匙，再看陆照临的木牌。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1360,
          "end": 1360
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈执事让你来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1362,
          "end": 1362
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1364,
          "end": 1364
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三架，最底层，只看写着西坡的卷宗。看完放回原处。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1366,
          "end": 1366
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果卷宗少了呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1368,
          "end": 1368
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老者看了他一眼：“那就当它从来没有在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1370,
          "end": 1370
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "档房内弥漫着霉味与干燥墨香。三排木架从地面一直顶到屋梁，卷宗按年份和院落分列。陆照临找到第三架，最底层只有七卷，封皮上的“西坡”二字大多被水浸过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1372,
          "end": 1372
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第一卷记载旧阵维修，第二卷记载药圃移栽，第三卷是夜巡轮值。翻到第四卷时，他看见一张补录纸，日期正是三年前冬至前七日。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1374,
          "end": 1374
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸上写着：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1376,
          "end": 1376
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“引灯人陆沉舟，奉命送灯至西坡旧井。同行三人，名录另附。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1378,
          "end": 1378
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "名录处却是一片空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1380,
          "end": 1380
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把纸举到窗缝的光里。纸纤维没有被撕过，空白像是原本就没有写字。然而纸张边缘残留着极浅的灰白印痕，和废井石片上的纹路相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1382,
          "end": 1382
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他继续往后翻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1384,
          "end": 1384
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯未归，旧井封闭。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1386,
          "end": 1386
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "下一页被整齐裁掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1388,
          "end": 1388
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临按住裁口，发现纸背粘着一小块薄薄的铜箔。铜箔上刻着半个名字：叶——。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1390,
          "end": 1390
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外忽然响起脚步。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1392,
          "end": 1392
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可他奉命送灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1418,
          "end": 1418
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“引灯人受宗门雇佣，不计入弟子名册。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1420,
          "end": 1420
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那为什么要把同行者的名字裁掉？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1422,
          "end": 1422
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋回头看他：“因为他们没有回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1424,
          "end": 1424
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“和陆沉舟一样？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1426,
          "end": 1426
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只确认三个人都失踪。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1428,
          "end": 1428
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离打开手里的信：“我查到一件事。三年前冬至前七日，顾氏旁支也有三名账房离开北地，目的地写的是无灯镇。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1430,
          "end": 1430
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向她：“无灯镇在旧驿道上？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1432,
          "end": 1432
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第一站。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1434,
          "end": 1434
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋的神情骤然变得严厉：“你们不准下山。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1436,
          "end": 1436
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封山令还要多久？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1438,
          "end": 1438
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“至少七日。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1440,
          "end": 1440
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“七日足够有人把镇上的记录烧干净。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1442,
          "end": 1442
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋把信从她手里抽走：“你家族的账，不要牵连玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1444,
          "end": 1444
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它已经牵连了。”顾长离说，“账上有玄霄宗的印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1446,
          "end": 1446
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "档房里一阵沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1448,
          "end": 1448
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把第四卷放回架上，袖中的铜箔贴着皮肤，传来微弱的热意。那半个名字到底是叶观澜，还是另一个姓叶的人？他没有证据，不能把猜测当成答案。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1450,
          "end": 1450
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋走到他面前，压低声音：“今晚之前，把你从西坡带走的所有东西交给我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1452,
          "end": 1452
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括残印？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1454,
          "end": 1454
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的眼神第一次出现明显的震动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1456,
          "end": 1456
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你碰过它？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1458,
          "end": 1458
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只确认它在我掌心留下了痕迹。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1460,
          "end": 1460
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋伸手想抓他的手腕，陆照临却后退一步。顾长离同时上前半步，铜针在袖中发出轻响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1462,
          "end": 1462
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老者咳得更重：“档房内不得动手。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1464,
          "end": 1464
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋收回手：“残印不是力量，是债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1466,
          "end": 1466
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁的债？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1468,
          "end": 1468
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所有还记得它的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1470,
          "end": 1470
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她说完便转身离开。顾长离没有立刻跟上，而是从袖中取出一张薄纸，塞进陆照临手里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1472,
          "end": 1472
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸上画着一条旧驿道，第一站的灯被人用墨涂黑。旁边写着一行小字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1474,
          "end": 1474
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“无灯镇只在夜里无灯，白日仍有守门人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1476,
          "end": 1476
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要下山？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1478,
          "end": 1478
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是现在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1480,
          "end": 1480
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1482,
          "end": 1482
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "锁舌轻响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-085",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1522,
          "end": 1522
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我父亲去过那里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1582,
          "end": 1582
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你只知道他曾经被记录在西坡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1584,
          "end": 1584
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在我知道三个人在无灯镇未归。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1586,
          "end": 1586
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她看着他，语气很轻：“知道得越多，能回头的路越少。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1588,
          "end": 1588
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临收起地图：“我想知道剩下两个人是谁。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1590,
          "end": 1590
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有阻拦。她从桌下取出一盏普通引路灯，递给他。灯芯完整，灯油清亮，灯罩内壁却刻着一道极浅的缺口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1592,
          "end": 1592
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“带上它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1594,
          "end": 1594
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗的灯？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1596,
          "end": 1596
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“路上若有人问，就说是我准许你带走的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1598,
          "end": 1598
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果没人问呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1600,
          "end": 1600
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就别点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1602,
          "end": 1602
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把灯收进包中。他正要离开，沈砚秋忽然叫住他：“陆沉舟不是叛徒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1604,
          "end": 1604
        }
      }
    ],
